Description: An all-in-one computer vision and machine learning ecosystem for
    plant phenomics, digital agriculture, and phytopathometry (Olivoto, 2022
    <doi:10.1111/2041-210X.13803>; Olivoto et al., 2022
    <doi:10.1007/s40858-021-00487-5>). Provides high-throughput single-
    and batch-image workflows for leaf area quantification, seed and grain
    counting, disease severity scoring, color indexes, shape analysis,
    landmark identification, and Elliptical Fourier Analysis of outlines
    (Claude, 2008 <doi:10.1007/978-0-387-77789-4>). Supports field-scale
    phenotyping from UAV and satellite RGB, multispectral, and hyperspectral
    orthomosaics with automated plot-grid shapefile layout design. Integrates
    state-of-the-art deep learning architectures including YOLO (Jocher et al.,
    2023 <doi:10.5281/zenodo.7398419>), Segment Anything (Kirillov et al., 2023
    <doi:10.1109/ICCV51070.2023.00371>; Ravi et al., 2024
    <arXiv:2408.00714>), Grounding DINO (Liu et al., 2023 <arXiv:2303.05499>),
    PerSAM (Zhang et al., 2023 <doi:10.1109/CVPR52729.2023.01899>), StarDist
    (Schmidt et al., 2018 <doi:10.1007/978-3-030-00934-2_30>), CLIP (Radford
    et al., 2021 <arXiv:2103.00020>), SAHI (Akyon et al., 2022
    <doi:10.1109/ICIP46590.2022.9897365>), DBNet/PaddleOCR (Liao et al., 2020
    <doi:10.1609/aaai.v34i07.6812>), Zero-DCE (Guo et al., 2020
    <doi:10.1109/CVPR42600.2020.00185>), and NAFNet (Chen et al., 2022
    <doi:10.1007/978-3-031-19772-7_2>) for zero-shot, few-shot, and custom
    object detection, instance segmentation, keypoint pose estimation, scene
    text recognition, image restoration, automated dataset curation, model
    training, and asynchronous parallel batch inference.
